"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/deployments","created_at":"2018-11-27T03:35:03Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T09:08:20Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-10T20:45:00Z","git_url":"git://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy","homepage":"https://www.sqlalchemy.org","size":99269,"stargazers_count":11252,"watchers_count":11252,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1606,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":205,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["python","sql","sqlalchemy"],"visibility":"public","forks":1606,"open_issues":205,"watchers":11252,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### Describe the bug\n\nSQLAlchemy raises error on next transaction after isolation_level=\"AUTOCOMMIT\" query. It affects \"future engines\" (`create_engine(..., future=True)`).\n\n### To Reproduce\n\n```python\nimport sqlalchemy as sa\r\n\r\nengine = sa.create_engine('postgresql://...',\r\n                          echo=True, future=True)\r\nwith engine.connect() as connection:\r\n    connection \\\r\n        .execution_options(isolation_level='AUTOCOMMIT') \\\r\n        .execute(sa.text(\"select 1;\"))\r\n\r\n    with connection.begin():\r\n        connection.execute(sa.text('select 2'))\n```\n\n\n### Error\n\n```\r\n# Copy complete stack trace and error message here, including SQL log output if applicable.\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,427 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine select pg_catalog.version()\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,428 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [raw sql] {}\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,432 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine select current_schema()\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,432 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [raw sql] {}\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,436 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine show standard_conforming_strings\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,436 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [raw sql] {}\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,440 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine BEGIN (implicit)\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,440 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine select 1;\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,441 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [generated in 0.00026s] {}\r\n2021-10-05 01:34:44,443 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine ROLLBACK using DBAPI connection.rollback(), DBAPI should ignore due to autocommit mode\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \".../main.py\", line 10, in <module>\r\n    with connection.begin():\r\n  File \".../venv/lib/python3.9/site-packages/sqlalchemy/future/engine.py\", line 144, in begin\r\n    return super(Connection, self).begin()\r\n  File \".../venv/lib/python3.9/site-packages/sqlalchemy/engine/base.py\", line 766, in begin\r\n    raise exc.InvalidRequestError(\r\nsqlalchemy.exc.InvalidRequestError: a transaction is already begun for this connection\r\n\r\nProcess finished with exit code 1\r\n\r\n``` \n\n### Versions\n\n- OS: ArchLinux\r\n- Python: 3.9.7\r\n- SQLAlchemy: 1.4.25\r\n- Database: PostgreSQL\r\n- DBAPI (eg: psycopg, cx_oracle, mysqlclient): psycopg with future=True and asyncpg\r\n\n\n### Additional context\n\nThis bug affects alembic `.autocommit_block()` with the same error.\r\nLooks like same issue https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/6701.\r\n\r\nIMHO the root of the problem is somewere at https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/blob/master/lib/sqlalchemy/engine/base.py#L1722. There is no isolation_level check.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/7141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/7141/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/comments/933778865","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/944#issuecomment-933778865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/944","id":933778865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX47u843qFWx","user":{"login":"sqla-tester","id":8250554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNTA1NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8250554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqla-tester","html_url":"https://github.com/sqla-tester","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqla-tester/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqla-tester/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqla-tester/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqla-tester/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqla-tester/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqla-tester/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqla-tester/repos","e